    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting to even think about \"one small step\" when the whole path is just... broken. everything feels so much easier when i'm just alone in my head and not having to exist. like, if i could just stop the noise, if i could just be at peace, that would be better than any \"support\" or \"therapy\" ever could be. don't you think? sometimes it just feels like the only logical way to actually get some peace is to just not be here anymore.",
